"""helm — Human-Controlled AI Engineering Framework CLI.

HUMAN-ONLY (denied to the agent by the guard, and TTY-gated):
  start, work, continue, review, approve, reject, unblock, abort, finish, baseline, integrity, bootstrap, skills add,
  violations --ack, doctor --live
AGENT-SAFE:
  status, check, verify, metrics, log, doctor, skills verify|list
CI (no key, no state): ci
"""
